{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIyL1dpZmVsaWtlJTIwJTI4MjAyMiUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Wifelike","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/tea2gDZPxw0wfKC2S2VRWHagtt4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3xvdNyZ9WsVJpyeGhm85fukeZz4.jpg","description":"A grieving detective in the near-future hunts down criminals who trade artificial humans on the black market. In the fight to end AI exploitation, an underground resistance attempts to infiltrate him by sabotaging the programming of the artificial human assigned as his companion to behave like his late wife. She begins to question her reality as memories of a past life begin to surface in a world where nothing is as it seems.","releaseInfo":"2022","genres":["Science Fiction","Mystery","Thriller","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.5","runtime":"105 min","cast":["Elena Kampouris","Jonathan Rhys Meyers","Doron Bell","Agam Darshi","Sara Sampaio","Alix Villaret","Fletcher Donovan","C.J. Perry Barnyashev"],"director":["James Bird"],"released":"2022-08-12T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"They're too human to be perfect. She's too perfect to be human.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Elena Kampouris","character":"Meredith","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/smQnz0PqKG2x3GKdmavV4Ea9JQt.jpg"},{"name":"Jonathan Rhys Meyers","character":"William","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3MvT0B15nt5JLp1dUcxmbqmjHUc.jpg"},{"name":"Doron Bell","character":"Agent Black","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cWeGCpNkOPworRp3tfSCnpI3YdB.jpg"},{"name":"Agam Darshi","character":"Louise","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rJoqe224bDWl03fnSqrUPt9QfLn.jpg"},{"name":"Sara Sampaio","character":"Wendy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8Uk7j05p6bSeJbMYri4ljw3ILr1.jpg"},{"name":"Alix Villaret","character":"Lydie","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yUJZgLhUb3xy8vkWOS3gS9qdsot.jpg"},{"name":"Fletcher Donovan","character":"Keene","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1